OL,3,GNEWSAM2 northbound closed due to lorry
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M2 is closed northbound due to a
OL,7,Florry on fire close to Glengormley.
OL,9,FThe road has been closed from
OL,10,FGreencastle to Sandyknowes roundabout.
OL,12,FThe Northern Ireland Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService said they received a call at
OL,14,F15:58 GMT on Wednesday. Three
OL,15,Fappliances are currently in attendance
OL,16,Fand the incident is ongoing.
OL,18,FPolice have said road users should
OL,19,Fexpect traffic delays and seek an
OL,20,Falternative route, if possible.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
